OL,3,ASomali pirates killed oil tanker crew
OL,4,Abefore rescue, official tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive crew members of an oil tanker
OL,7,Fseized by pirates off the coast of
OL,8,FSomalia were killed before local
OL,9,Fsecurity forces retook the vessel, a
OL,10,Fsenior regional official has told the
OL,11,FBBC.
OL,13,FPuntland Deputy Information Minister
OL,14,FBile Qabowsade said the five were
OL,15,Fkilled by pirates before regional
OL,16,Fforces boarded MT Hoarner 25.
OL,18,FHe said the dead included three
OL,19,FPakistani nationals, one Indian and one
OL,20,Fnational of Myanmar. Four other crew
OL,21,Fmembers were injured, including three
OL,22,FPakistanis and one Indian.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
