OL,3,ASomali pirates killed oil tanker crew
OL,4,Abefore rescue, official tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tanker, which was carrying about
OL,7,F18,500 barrels of oil destined for the
OL,8,FSomali capital, Mogadishu, was seized
OL,9,Fin April by six armed men while sailing
OL,10,Foff the coast of Somalia.
